# Compiler scratch. dosbuild.py wipes this at the start of every invocation,
# so nothing here survives a build of anything else.
build/

# A writable copy of bin/ plus the built harnesses. Reproduce it with
#   cp bin/* run/   and a build; dosbuild.py installs the .EXEs into it.
run/

# The Ghidra project -- 53 MB, holds live .lock files, and is rebuilt by
# importing work/split/*.exe. The analysis itself lives in docs/ and src/.
work/ghidra/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.bak

# Local tooling config -- machine-specific paths, not part of the project.
.mcp.json
.claude/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEUROSIS.008 is NOT Asphyxia code. It is JCAB / VangeliSTeam's DemoVT v1.31,
# a third-party mod player that Psycho Neurosis shells out to. Its unpacked
# image lives here because this is the tree that split it out of the demo.
#
# THE RECONSTRUCTION OF IT HAS MOVED and is no longer ignored -- it is its own
# tracked repository of its own -- a VangeliSTracker checkout alongside
# this one, which is also where the 1.39b source release now lives. Nothing about DemoVT is under this tree any
# more except the unpacked image below.
#
# tools/unlzexe.py is deliberately NOT excluded: it is original code about the
# LZEXE container format and contains nothing of DemoVT's.
work/unpack/

# The marker file for where to go next. A LOCAL working register: it holds
# real local paths and a running status that is nobody's deliverable, so it
# is not tracked. Its history up to 19 Aug 2026 is in the log as
# docs/24-continuation.md.
docs/continuation.md
